00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.768
doing the podcast and there's video

00:10:06.768 --> 00:10:09.025
won't do as well on video
'cause that's secondary.

00:10:09.025 --> 00:10:11.671
Here, audio is secondary.

00:10:11.671 --> 00:10:13.994
But, so that's it, that's
the net result, Mike.

00:10:13.994 --> 00:10:15.599
But I think the right platform

00:10:15.599 --> 00:10:17.472
is the right platform for you.

00:10:17.472 --> 00:10:19.955
I think that I have the
charisma and the antics

00:10:19.955 --> 00:10:23.186
and the control of the
camera that very few have,

00:10:23.186 --> 00:10:26.496
which is why I've had two
successful video shows

00:10:26.496 --> 00:10:28.368
and so I think I'm an anomaly there

00:10:28.368 --> 00:10:32.068
and I'm gonna milk that because
that has extraordinary value

00:10:32.068 --> 00:10:34.413
but there's plenty of
other people who crush it

00:10:34.413 --> 00:10:35.351
'cause their voice is deep.

00:10:35.351 --> 00:10:36.753
My voice stinks.

00:10:36.753 --> 00:10:38.680
