many great voices there are.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:41.079
And so, like, you know,
if you're rolling deep,

00:10:41.079 --> 00:10:42.076
you're gonna do some stuff,

00:10:42.076 --> 00:10:44.898
so I think you got to pick your medium

00:10:44.898 --> 00:10:46.042
and that's the same with social network.

00:10:46.042 --> 00:10:48.002
So you're better at
Snapchat, Twitter, Facebook,

00:10:48.002 --> 00:10:49.138
gotta find that and you gotta respect

00:10:49.138 --> 00:10:51.644
the context of the platform.

